---
import BaseLayout from "@layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="The First 60 Days — Free Onboarding Call for Law Firm Owners"
  description="How to onboard a remote staff member who actually sticks. Book a free call and find out which week of the 60-day plan your firm is missing."
  noindex={true}
  schema={{
    "@type": "WebPage",
    "name": "The First 60 Days",
    "description": "A free staffing call for law firm owners about onboarding a remote staff member who actually sticks.",
    "publisher": {
      "@type": "Organization",
      "name": "Attorney Assistant"
    }
  }}
>

  <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════════
       HERO
  ═══════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-brand-950 min-h-[90vh] flex items-center">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-navy via-brand-900 to-brand-950"></div>
    <div class="lp-orb lp-orb--1" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="lp-orb lp-orb--2" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="lp-orb lp-orb--3" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="grain-overlay"></div>

    <div class="absolute inset-0 z-[1] opacity-[0.03]" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="absolute inset-0" style="background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,0.5) 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.5) 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 60px 60px;"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="container-wide relative z-10 py-20 lg:py-28">
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-start">
        <div class="reveal">
          <div class="mb-5">
            <span class="lp-pulse-badge">
              <span class="lp-pulse-dot"></span>
              For Law Firm Owners
            </span>
          </div>
          <h1 class="text-display-md md:text-display-lg lg:text-display-xl font-heading text-white leading-tight mb-5">
            The hire didn't fail. <span class="text-gradient-gold">The handoff did.</span>
          </h1>
          <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-gray-300 mb-8 leading-relaxed">
            How to onboard a remote staff member who actually sticks &mdash; the exact 60-day plan, not a start date treated as a finish line.
          </p>

          <!-- Stat ticker -->
          <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-4 mb-10">
            <div class="lp-hero-stat">
              <span class="lp-hero-stat-num lp-count" data-target="60">0</span>
              <span class="lp-hero-stat-label">days of structured attention a new hire actually needs</span>
            </div>
            <div class="lp-hero-stat">
              <span class="lp-hero-stat-num lp-count" data-target="4">0</span>
              <span class="lp-hero-stat-label">reasons a good hire leaves in month four</span>
            </div>
            <div class="lp-hero-stat">
              <span class="lp-hero-stat-num lp-count" data-target="5">0</span>
              <span class="lp-hero-stat-label">hours in week one that keep them past week six</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- What the call covers -->
          <div class="space-y-4 mb-10">
            <p class="text-xs font-bold text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-widest">On Your Call We'll Cover</p>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
              <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-brand-gold/10 flex items-center justify-center mt-0.5">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-brand-gold" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M3.75 13.5l10.5-11.25L12 10.5h8.25L9.75 21.75 12 13.5H3.75z" /></svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <p class="text-base font-semibold text-white">The five things to do before they log in</p>
                <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-0.5">The handoff sheet, the logins, the first real task &mdash; done the week before, not the day of.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
              <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-brand-gold/10 flex items-center justify-center mt-0.5">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-brand-gold" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M2.25 18L9 11.25l4.306 4.306a11.95 11.95 0 015.814-5.518l2.74-1.22m0 0l-5.94-2.281m5.94 2.28l-2.28 5.941" /></svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <p class="text-base font-semibold text-white">Which week your current plan is missing</p>
                <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-0.5">Most firms have a start date and nothing else. We'll show you what fills weeks two through eight.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
              <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-brand-gold/10 flex items-center justify-center mt-0.5">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-brand-gold" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M6.75 3v2.25M17.25 3v2.25M3 18.75V7.5a2.25 2.25 0 012.25-2.25h13.5A2.25 2.25 0 0121 7.5v11.25m-18 0A2.25 2.25 0 005.25 21h13.5A2.25 2.25 0 0021 18.75m-18 0v-7.5A2.25 2.25 0 015.25 9h13.5A2.25 2.25 0 0121 11.25v7.5" /></svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <p class="text-base font-semibold text-white">The three conversations that keep a hire</p>
                <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-0.5">What to say on day one, week three, and day thirty &mdash; most owners assume this part and lose the hire.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4 text-sm text-gray-400">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-brand-gold" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.704 4.153a.75.75 0 01.143 1.052l-8 10.5a.75.75 0 01-1.127.075l-4.5-4.5a.75.75 0 011.06-1.06l3.894 3.893 7.48-9.817a.75.75 0 011.05-.143z" clip-rule="evenodd" /></svg>
              Free &mdash; 30 minutes
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-brand-gold" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.704 4.153a.75.75 0 01.143 1.052l-8 10.5a.75.75 0 01-1.127.075l-4.5-4.5a.75.75 0 011.06-1.06l3.894 3.893 7.48-9.817a.75.75 0 011.05-.143z" clip-rule="evenodd" /></svg>
              No commitment
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-brand-gold" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.704 4.153a.75.75 0 01.143 1.052l-8 10.5a.75.75 0 01-1.127.075l-4.5-4.5a.75.75 0 011.06-1.06l3.894 3.893 7.48-9.817a.75.75 0 011.05-.143z" clip-rule="evenodd" /></svg>
              Built inside a working law firm
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Booking Widget -->
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-1 shadow-2xl ring-1 ring-white/10 reveal lp-widget-glow" style="transition-delay: 150ms" id="book-now">
          <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-4 md:p-5">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
              <div class="featured-icon featured-icon-md featured-icon-gold">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M6.75 3v2.25M17.25 3v2.25M3 18.75V7.5a2.25 2.25 0 012.25-2.25h13.5A2.25 2.25 0 0121 7.5v11.25m-18 0A2.25 2.25 0 005.25 21h13.5A2.25 2.25 0 0021 18.75m-18 0v-7.5A2.25 2.25 0 015.25 9h13.5A2.25 2.25 0 0121 11.25v7.5" /></svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <h2 class="text-lg font-heading text-gray-900">Book Your Staffing Call</h2>
                <p class="text-xs text-gray-500">Free &mdash; 30 minutes</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="meetings-iframe-container" data-src="https://meet.attorneyassistant.com/meetings/attorney-assistant/magnet-first-60-days-with-an-ia?embed=true"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="absolute bottom-8 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 z-10 lp-scroll-hint" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="w-6 h-10 rounded-full border-2 border-white/20 flex justify-center pt-2">
        <div class="w-1 h-2.5 bg-brand-gold rounded-full lp-scroll-dot"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════════
       OPENING — the story + four reasons a hire leaves
  ═══════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-gray-950 lp-section-lg">
    <div class="absolute inset-0">
      <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-[500px] h-[500px] bg-brand-gold/5 rounded-full blur-[120px]"></div>
      <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-[400px] h-[400px] bg-red-500/3 rounded-full blur-[100px]"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="grain-overlay"></div>

    <div class="container-wide relative z-10">
      <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-20 items-center">
        <!-- Left: Story -->
        <div class="reveal">
          <span class="badge bg-brand-gold/15 text-brand-gold border-brand-gold/20 mb-6">Read This First</span>
          <h2 class="text-display-sm md:text-display-md font-heading text-white mb-5 leading-tight">
            You found a good person. By month four, they gave notice.
          </h2>
          <p class="text-lg text-gray-400 leading-relaxed mb-6">
            They started on a Monday, got a login and a list of tasks, and you went back to your caseload. By week six the questions had stopped, which you read as competence. By month four they gave notice, which you read as proof that hiring doesn't work.
          </p>
          <p class="text-base text-gray-500 leading-relaxed mb-6">
            It works. What doesn't work is treating a start date as a finish line. A new staff member, remote or in the office, needs about 60 days of structured attention before they run on their own. Most firms give them two.
          </p>
          <p class="text-xl font-heading text-brand-gold">
            The hire didn't fail. The handoff did.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Right: four reasons a good hire leaves -->
        <div class="reveal space-y-4" style="transition-delay: 150ms">
          <div class="lp-pain-card lp-pain-card--stagger-1">
            <div class="lp-pain-icon">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 6.75h.007v.008H12V6.75zm.375 6a9.75 9.75 0 100-13.5 9.75 9.75 0 000 13.5z" /></svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <p class="text-white font-heading text-base">1 &middot; No process to follow</p>
              <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm mt-1">The firm's way of doing things lives in the owner's head. The new person guesses, gets corrected, guesses again, and concludes nothing they do is right.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="lp-pain-card lp-pain-card--stagger-2">
            <div class="lp-pain-icon">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 9v3.75m-9.303 3.376c-.866 1.5.217 3.374 1.948 3.374h14.71c1.73 0 2.813-1.874 1.948-3.374L13.949 3.378c-.866-1.5-3.032-1.5-3.898 0L2.697 16.126ZM12 15.75h.007v.008H12v-.008z" /></svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <p class="text-white font-heading text-base">2 &middot; No early win</p>
              <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm mt-1">They spend three weeks on setup, shadowing, and reading. Nothing they touched closed, signed, or shipped. Motivation drains before competence arrives.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="lp-pain-card lp-pain-card--stagger-3">
            <div class="lp-pain-icon">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M8.25 15.75a3 3 0 106 0 3 3 0 00-6 0z" /><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M2.25 9.776c.19-.937.546-1.822 1.025-2.638M21.75 9.776a9.76 9.76 0 00-1.025-2.638" /></svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <p class="text-white font-heading text-base">3 &middot; Silence read as success</p>
              <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm mt-1">Questions drop off in week three. The owner relaxes. The person stopped asking because the answers took two days to arrive.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="lp-pain-card" style="animation: lpSlideIn 0.5s ease 0.55s both;">
            <div class="lp-pain-icon">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 9v3.75m0 3.75h.008v.008H12V16.5zm-9.303 3.376c-.866 1.5.217 3.374 1.948 3.374h14.71c1.73 0 2.813-1.874 1.948-3.374L13.949 3.378c-.866-1.5-3.032-1.5-3.898 0L2.697 16.126z" /></svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <p class="text-white font-heading text-base">4 &middot; Feedback only when something breaks</p>
              <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm mt-1">The first real conversation about performance is the one where a client complained. By then the pattern is six weeks old.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="lp-quote-banner mt-14 max-w-3xl mx-auto reveal">
        &ldquo;You will get a trained person, and you will still need to train them on how your firm does things.&rdquo;
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════════
       FIVE THINGS DONE BEFORE THEY LOG IN
  ═══════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-white lp-section-lg">
    <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-1 bg-gradient-to-r from-red-500 via-brand-gold to-brand-blue"></div>
    <div class="container-wide">
      <div class="text-center mb-12 reveal">
        <span class="badge bg-brand-navy/10 text-brand-navy border-brand-navy/15 mb-4">The Week Before</span>
        <h2 class="text-display-sm md:text-display-md font-heading text-gray-900 mb-4">
          Five things done before they log in.
        </h2>
        <p class="text-lg text-gray-500 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
          Every one of these is a scheduling problem, not a hiring problem.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-5 reveal mb-10 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        <div class="flex gap-4 p-5 rounded-xl bg-gray-50 border border-gray-100">
          <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-brand-navy/10 flex items-center justify-center text-brand-navy font-heading font-bold">1</div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-heading text-gray-900 mb-1">Write the one-page handoff sheet</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Role, outcomes, first three tasks, who they ask, when you meet.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex gap-4 p-5 rounded-xl bg-gray-50 border border-gray-100">
          <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-brand-navy/10 flex items-center justify-center text-brand-navy font-heading font-bold">2</div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-heading text-gray-900 mb-1">Create every login the role needs</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Case management, phone, email, calendar, document storage. Test each one.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex gap-4 p-5 rounded-xl bg-gray-50 border border-gray-100">
          <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-brand-navy/10 flex items-center justify-center text-brand-navy font-heading font-bold">3</div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-heading text-gray-900 mb-1">Record three short screen videos</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">How a matter opens, how a client note is logged, how to flag a problem. They'll watch these more than they'll read.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex gap-4 p-5 rounded-xl bg-gray-50 border border-gray-100">
          <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-brand-navy/10 flex items-center justify-center text-brand-navy font-heading font-bold">4</div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-heading text-gray-900 mb-1">Pick their first real task</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Small enough to finish in week one. A finished thing, not a hard thing.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="lp-rule-box max-w-3xl mx-auto reveal mb-10 text-center">
        <span class="lp-rule-box-label">Tip</span>
        <p class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-heading text-brand-navy">If you cannot find five hours in week one, you are not ready to hire. Push the start date, not the plan.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="lp-quote-banner max-w-2xl mx-auto reveal">
        &ldquo;The 30-day review is the single most skipped step in onboarding. Firms that hold it keep the hire.&rdquo;
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════════
       THE 60-DAY ARC
  ═══════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden lp-section-lg">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-navy via-brand-900 to-brand-950"></div>
    <div class="absolute top-20 right-0 w-[500px] h-[500px] bg-brand-gold/8 rounded-full blur-[100px]"></div>
    <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-[400px] h-[400px] bg-brand-blue/8 rounded-full blur-[100px]"></div>
    <div class="grain-overlay"></div>

    <div class="container-wide relative z-10">
      <div class="text-center mb-10 reveal">
        <span class="badge bg-brand-gold/15 text-brand-gold border-brand-gold/20 mb-4">The Plan</span>
        <h2 class="text-display-sm md:text-display-md font-heading text-white mb-5">
          Sixty days, <span class="text-gradient-gold">four stages.</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="text-lg text-gray-400 max-w-2xl mx-auto">By day 60 the role should run without you touching it. Here's the order that gets you there.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto reveal mb-14">
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center gap-2 sm:gap-4 py-5 border-b border-white/10">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 sm:w-48 flex-shrink-0">
            <span class="w-9 h-9 rounded-full bg-brand-blue/20 flex items-center justify-center text-brand-blue font-heading font-bold flex-shrink-0">1</span>
            <p class="text-[11px] font-bold text-brand-blue uppercase tracking-widest">Weeks 1&ndash;2</p>
          </div>
          <div class="flex-1">
            <h3 class="text-white font-heading text-base mb-1">Learn the firm</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">Watch, then do one thing, with daily 20-minute check-ins. By Friday of week two, hand them one complete lane and drop check-ins to twice a week.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center gap-2 sm:gap-4 py-5 border-b border-white/10">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 sm:w-48 flex-shrink-0">
            <span class="w-9 h-9 rounded-full bg-brand-gold/20 flex items-center justify-center text-brand-gold font-heading font-bold flex-shrink-0">2</span>
            <p class="text-[11px] font-bold text-brand-gold uppercase tracking-widest">Weeks 3&ndash;4</p>
          </div>
          <div class="flex-1">
            <h3 class="text-white font-heading text-base mb-1">Add a second lane, then step back</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">Give them the escalation rule in one sentence: "Come to me when ___." Hold the 30-day review: what they own, what's unclear, what days 31 to 60 look like.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center gap-2 sm:gap-4 py-5 border-b border-white/10">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 sm:w-48 flex-shrink-0">
            <span class="w-9 h-9 rounded-full bg-white/10 flex items-center justify-center text-white font-heading font-bold flex-shrink-0">3</span>
            <p class="text-[11px] font-bold text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-widest">Weeks 5&ndash;6</p>
          </div>
          <div class="flex-1">
            <h3 class="text-white font-heading text-base mb-1">Full ownership</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">They own every lane in the role. You stop reviewing work before it goes out and start reviewing a sample after. Introduce the scorecard, tracked weekly.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center gap-2 sm:gap-4 py-5">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 sm:w-48 flex-shrink-0">
            <span class="w-9 h-9 rounded-full bg-white/10 flex items-center justify-center text-white font-heading font-bold flex-shrink-0">4</span>
            <p class="text-[11px] font-bold text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-widest">Weeks 7&ndash;8</p>
          </div>
          <div class="flex-1">
            <h3 class="text-white font-heading text-base mb-1">Improve the process, then the day 60 review</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">Ask them to write down one process the firm does badly and how they'd fix it. Then the question that tells you whether it worked: "If I was out for two weeks, what would break?"</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-5 reveal mb-6">
        <div class="lp-stat-box lp-stat-box--highlight">
          <div class="lp-stat-box-num lp-stat-box-num--gold">97%</div>
          <p class="lp-stat-box-label">Answer rate 24/7, up from 82%</p>
        </div>
        <div class="lp-stat-box lp-stat-box--highlight">
          <div class="lp-stat-box-num lp-stat-box-num--gold">15 min</div>
          <p class="lp-stat-box-label">Max speed to lead, down from 34</p>
        </div>
        <div class="lp-stat-box lp-stat-box--highlight">
          <div class="lp-stat-box-num lp-stat-box-num--gold">6</div>
          <p class="lp-stat-box-label">Follow-up touches in 3 days</p>
        </div>
        <div class="lp-stat-box lp-stat-box--highlight">
          <div class="lp-stat-box-num lp-stat-box-num--gold">109</div>
          <p class="lp-stat-box-label">Cases signed by one staff member in 30 days</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="text-center text-xs text-gray-500 mb-10 reveal">Attorney Assistant client figures, real client files, identities protected.</p>

      <div class="text-center reveal">
        <a href="#book-now" class="btn-primary btn-lg group inline-flex">
          Get Your 60-Day Plan
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 transition-transform duration-200 group-hover:translate-x-0.5" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor">
